(defun hive-mcp-attention-enable (&optional root)
  "Start publishing blocking prompts under ROOT. Idempotent.\nhive-emacs passes the root it reads from, so both sides agree by construction;\na nil ROOT falls back to `hive-mcp-attention-directory' and the environment."
